//
// cppcheck suppressions (chapter 14 §14.8.4, WI-0.559). One line per suppression, each with a comment
// naming why. Prefer an inline `// cppcheck-suppress <id>` next to the code (--inline-suppr is on).
// Format: <id>[:<file glob>[:<line>]]
//
// Third-party code is never analysed: the nightly job only passes OVT translation units.
missingIncludeSystem
